<%# The page for waiting on the confirmation email. #633.

    Sign-up used to land on /login, where the biggest thing on the page was a form asking for a
    password nobody had chosen yet -- since #575 the password is chosen from the emailed link --
    and the only way to have the link sent again was to fail that sign-in first. This page
    says what happened, to which address, and what to do if nothing arrives.

    The address is shown because a typo is otherwise invisible until no mail comes. It comes
    from this browser's own session, set at sign-up, so it tells nobody anything they did not
    just type; and the resend below is answered the same way whether or not the address has an
    account, so this page opens no new enumeration door (app.rb's resend hook has the argument).

    "Start over" goes to the sign-up form rather than doing anything to the account behind the
    wrong address. That account can never be confirmed by anybody but whoever reads that inbox,
    which is the whole of what #575 promises about it. %>
<div class="flex min-h-full flex-col justify-center px-6 py-12 lg:px-8">
  <div class="sm:mx-auto sm:w-full sm:max-w-sm">
    <h1 class="text-center text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900">Check your email</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-center text-sm text-gray-600">
      We sent a link to <span class="font-semibold text-gray-900"><%= @address %></span>.
      Open it to confirm the address; that is where you choose your password.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-center text-sm text-gray-600">
      Nothing there after a few minutes? Look in junk or spam, since a first message from a new
      sender often lands there.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-10 sm:mx-auto sm:w-full sm:max-w-sm">
    <form action="<%= rodauth.verify_account_resend_path %>" method="post" role="form" id="resend-form">
      <%== rodauth.csrf_tag(rodauth.verify_account_resend_path) %>
      <input type="hidden" name="login" value="<%= @address %>">
      <button type="submit" class="<%= button_style %> flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center bg-lime-500 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-900 hover:bg-lime-600">Send it again</button>
    </form>

    <p class="mt-10 text-center text-sm text-gray-500">
      Wrong address?
      <a href="/create-account" class="font-semibold leading-6 text-lime-700 hover:text-lime-800">Start over</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
